  "title": "ui prefs: Free modules on exit",
  "description": "As with the epan prefs, this isn't strictly necessary since this is\nat program exit, but LeakSanitizer, Valgrind, etc. will complain\notherwise:\n\n```shell\n==4077140==ERROR: LeakSanitizer: detected memory leaks\n\nDirect leak of 24 byte(s) in 1 object(s) allocated from:\n    #0 0x560cd18c6778 in malloc (/home/johnthacker/wireshark-qt6-clang-build/run/wireshark+0xcd778) (BuildId: 703284aa68b7f20ca651eaab70f3b02795947d98)\n    #1 0x7f779b6f1be9 in g_malloc (/lib64/libglib-2.0.so.0+0x47be9) (BuildId: 60b073eb3d9fdae8df0475fe94482883552ee86a)\n    #2 0x7f779b70bb74 in g_slice_alloc (/lib64/libglib-2.0.so.0+0x61b74) (BuildId: 60b073eb3d9fdae8df0475fe94482883552ee86a)\n    #3 0x7f779b6e528e in g_list_append (/lib64/libglib-2.0.so.0+0x3b28e) (BuildId: 60b073eb3d9fdae8df0475fe94482883552ee86a)\n    #4 0x7f77a0506040 in register_preference /home/johnthacker/wireshark/epan/prefs.c:1056:21\n    #5 0x7f77a0509114 in register_string_like_preference /home/johnthacker/wireshark/epan/prefs.c:1451:12\n    #6 0x7f77a050902e in prefs_register_string_preference /home/johnthacker/wireshark/epan/prefs.c:1577:5\n    #7 0x560cd344d287 in language_init /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/language.c:79:5\n    #8 0x560cd344ac5a in ui_init /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/init.c:25:5\n    #9 0x560cd22ea26f in main /home/johnthacker/wireshark/ui/qt/main.cpp:671:5\n```\n\nSee 6882a71a2eb8c6910fcdf0ca88f596232a3ddba3\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
